ue,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281613.jpg?_r=1420497791","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":45,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SchroederWedding2015","Id":281613,"Name":"SchroederWedding2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79024,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2ae8e36b681a5309a05ee6f7565499f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/239790-mrsktobe\/\" title=\"\"&gt;Mrsktobe&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;I would love a copy of this template too&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My FI and I both have huge families and it&#039;s looking like there will end up being close to 60 of us on the trip. A meet the guests booklet is going to be a must for people to remember who everyone is!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893200,"PostDate":1429091932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/239790-mrsktobe\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Mrsktobe<\/a>\u00a0<\/span>I would love a copy of this template too\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My FI and I both have huge families and it's looking like there will end up being close to 60 of us on the trip. A meet the guests booklet is going to be a must for people to remember who everyone is!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20160409\/e\/our+Wedding+Day\/k\/a16a\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"krystalball@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421846163,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1429807940","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"krystalball","Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79024,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd5a283eeb523445d622f6efa717488b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mrsktobe\"] Could I please see the template as well? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ll PM you my address.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893202,"PostDate":1429092405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"239790\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/239790-mrsktobe\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mrsktobe<\/span><\/a> Could I please see the template as well? \u00a0I'll PM you my address.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421424569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1427826222","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.119.165.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79024,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa8e577b4c3ecb48f8eacf2e00cf2f8c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I would love this as well!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893413,"PostDate":1429206113,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would love this as well!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415103095,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1421507914","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissFrench","Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.110.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79024,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"964537a5f9775a69b33a453821d9ab62","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This isn&#039;t exactly the same thing, but we started a Facebook group for our guests attending the wedding and we&#039;re doing \"Shout Outs\" for each guest. We include some pictures and tell the story of how we know them and something interesting about them. We end a lot of them with something like: \"For a fun fact about so-and-so, ask him about the time when we...\" so they even have something to talk about when they see them at the resort!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And, of course, it allows us to show our appreciation and how much these people mean to us.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is taking us awhile to get through them because we don&#039;t have a ton of free time and we try to be thoughtful with what we say about each person, but we&#039;re about 2\/3 of the way through our list. So far everyone LOVES it and they&#039;ve started interacting with each other on the group page.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893415,"PostDate":1429206724,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This isn't exactly the same thing, but we started a Facebook group for our guests attending the wedding and we're doing \"Shout Outs\" for each guest. We include some pictures and tell the story of how we know them and something interesting about them. We end a lot of them with something like: \"For a fun fact about so-and-so, ask him about the time when we...\" so they even have something to talk about when they see them at the resort!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And, of course, it allows us to show our appreciation and how much these people mean to us.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is taking us awhile to get through them because we don't have a ton of free time and we try to be thoughtful with what we say about each person, but we're about 2\/3 of the way through our list. So far everyone LOVES it and they've started interacting with each other on the group page.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403098087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.235.1.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79024,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2ffc2b7ff54b8ccb2ed5a963be8d807","RawContent":"oh I love the Facebook thing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893516,"PostDate":1429307989,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                oh I love the Facebook thing! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaspbri0317@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.58.144.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1296670027,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=1429022808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaspbri0317","Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.90.101.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79024,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99340621a67c1f46221da74d7e8464dc","RawContent":"Just wanted to update you girls on what I ended up doing! I love it and I&#039;m not a DIY girl so I am proud of myself :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1894014,"PostDate":1429741875,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just wanted to update you girls on what I ended up doing! I love it and I'm not a DIY girl so I am proud of myself <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1894014]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277044-0-51607400-1429759737.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  59.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277044-0-51607400-1429759737.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1894014]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277044-0-51319800-1429759759.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  72.45KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277044-0-51319800-1429759759.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1894014]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277044-0-21636300-1429759820.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  66.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277044-0-21636300-1429759820.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1894014]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277044-0-59348000-1429759797.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  66.39KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277044-0-59348000-1429759797.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394205869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79024,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b08eb4aacdc8dc9eca5ad551088409db","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"smileitseb\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ummmmm, HOW AWESOME!!!&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s soooo nice!!!!!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m just realizing, or re-realizing because I did know this, that your wedding is right around the corner!!!!!&amp;nbsp; eeeeeee!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894068,"PostDate":1429786614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277044\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277044-smileitseb\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smileitseb<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ummmmm, HOW AWESOME!!!\u00a0 It's soooo nice!!!!!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm just realizing, or re-realizing because I did know this, that your wedding is right around the corner!!!!!\u00a0 eeeeeee!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":20,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
