{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75456ec0581b3a0dd70cba0b0a5d2003","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Continuing my theme of gratitude I found the cutest little &#039;thank you hanky&#039; from the WeddingChicks website.&amp;nbsp; (which is my new obsession right now).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was thinking of ordering this hanky for my future mother in law.&amp;nbsp; I thought it would be so touching for her and it would definitely make her feel appreciated and loved. &amp;nbsp;They are $12 so I might get one for my dad and for my dad&#039;s wife as she has been pretty great too.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889168,"PostDate":1426239512,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Continuing my theme of gratitude I found the cutest little 'thank you hanky' from the WeddingChicks website.\u00a0 (which is my new obsession right now).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was thinking of ordering this hanky for my future mother in law.\u00a0 I thought it would be so touching for her and it would definitely make her feel appreciated and loved. \u00a0They are $12 so I might get one for my dad and for my dad's wife as she has been pretty great too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889168]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-77709400-1426257498.jpg\" title=\"blushingheart__75454_1409221972_1280_1280.jpg -  602.5KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-77709400-1426257498.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"blushingheart__75454_1409221972_1280_1280.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7eea759c3b70210f513e617ff0fecffa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love the hankie! It&#039;s super adorable. Just had a chance to look through your planning thread and I just wanted to say that i&#039;m glad you went with the first dress - it looks absolutely beautiful on you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889180,"PostDate":1426249463,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love the hankie! It's super adorable. Just had a chance to look through your planning thread and I just wanted to say that i'm glad you went with the first dress - it looks absolutely beautiful on you!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419419814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90b36019abdbccfeb8bfb0f51fc8257c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Aww thanks @[member=\"perianjay\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The dress really caught my attention.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m on #BeastMode right now and taking lots of step and pump classes to try to shed some lbs and get ready inside and out for the wedding.   I thought that dress #1 would showcase my progress better.&amp;nbsp; It really suits my personality too and I never saw myself as&amp;nbsp;a lace person, but I just fell in love with it.&amp;nbsp; It also seemed like it would fit in with the destination wedding theme.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love the hanky too!&amp;nbsp; I saw one that is for flower girls.&amp;nbsp; It says something like, this can be your something old for her wedding day.&amp;nbsp; how sweet is that??!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889182,"PostDate":1426252209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Aww thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>The dress really caught my attention.\u00a0 I'm on #BeastMode right now and taking lots of step and pump classes to try to shed some lbs and get ready inside and out for the wedding.\u00a0\u00a0 I thought that dress #1 would showcase my progress better.\u00a0 It really suits my personality too and I never saw myself as\u00a0a lace person, but I just fell in love with it.\u00a0 It also seemed like it would fit in with the destination wedding theme.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love the hanky too!\u00a0 I saw one that is for flower girls.\u00a0 It says something like, this can be your something old for her wedding day.\u00a0 how sweet is that??!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.53.12.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e370f8c80f66ea4d40876ea01bc6807","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes! I did something similar.. I actually purchased my dress in a size 6 and I usually wear a size 8 or 10 depending on how it fits me (i&#039;m busty too ..ugh). I bought it smaller so that I HAD to be motivated to fit into it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mine is also a lace mermaid :) .. except I always envisioned myself wearing lace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889184,"PostDate":1426253785,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes! I did something similar.. I actually purchased my dress in a size 6 and I usually wear a size 8 or 10 depending on how it fits me (i'm busty too ..ugh). I bought it smaller so that I HAD to be motivated to fit into it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Mine is also a lace mermaid <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> .. except I always envisioned myself wearing lace.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419419814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa5fb04fe5bc10499bd8f7b646cdecf9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"veryvalentine\" post=\"1889182\" timestamp=\"1426270209\"]\nAww thanks @[member=\"perianjay\"]\nThe dress really caught my attention.  I&#039;m on #BeastMode right now and taking lots of step and pump classes to try to shed some lbs and get ready inside and out for the wedding.   I thought that dress #1 would showcase my progress better.  It really suits my personality too and I never saw myself as a lace person, but I just fell in love with it.  It also seemed like it would fit in with the destination wedding theme.\n\nI love the hanky too!  I saw one that is for flower girls.  It says something like, this can be your something old for her wedding day.  how sweet is that??!![\/quote]We talking les mills? Love step and pump....and jam!!!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889204,"PostDate":1426276814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>veryvalentine, on 13 March 2015 - 01:10 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Aww thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a><br>\nThe dress really caught my attention.  I'm on #BeastMode right now and taking lots of step and pump classes to try to shed some lbs and get ready inside and out for the wedding.   I thought that dress #1 would showcase my progress better.  It really suits my personality too and I never saw myself as a lace person, but I just fell in love with it.  It also seemed like it would fit in with the destination wedding theme.<br><br>\nI love the hanky too!  I saw one that is for flower girls.  It says something like, this can be your something old for her wedding day.  how sweet is that??!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWe talking les mills? Love step and pump....and jam!!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b9cbb6f29f543cb5fae6780d7e82729","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Les mills has such good classes!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889240,"PostDate":1426331763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Les mills has such good classes!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.68.33.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1426452532,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92fb0703c44eb75135ac3f1668093c4e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] - totally talking Les Mills. &amp;nbsp;The FI and I a double class today, step class first and then pump! &amp;nbsp;Such a good morning. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We made some progress this weekend. &amp;nbsp;We bought the grooms gifts. &amp;nbsp;We found some great gifts at Fossil. &amp;nbsp;A travel bag perfect for the destination wedding with a luggage tag, passport holder. &amp;nbsp;I loved the passport holder because not only does carry the obvious, your passport but it has a special slot for the boarding pass and luggage receipt and a pen to fill out the travel cards in the plane. &amp;nbsp;Love it. &amp;nbsp;They also have a little card carrier for their hotel room key and some bills. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I took pictures of my bridesmaid gifts earlier but my camera was dying and my pics turned out yellowish so I retook them because they didn&#039;t do Kate Spade any justice. &amp;nbsp;I am making them all jewellery for their dresses. &amp;nbsp;Haven&#039;t designed the jewellery yet but I am also giving them this necklace that will be perfect for dinners at night. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance surprised me with a beachbag - so I&#039;m totally getting so excited to start packing these things away. &amp;nbsp;Overwhelmed.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think we found our cake topper. &amp;nbsp;Everyone I show it to doesn&#039;t get it though. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s the \"&amp;amp;\" sign. &amp;nbsp;lol so we may use it as part of the decor at the reception and place it in front and centre of us. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My future mother in law found these adorably cute shells with a little zipper. &amp;nbsp; I was thinking of either including them as a souvenir in our OOTD bags and putting a peso in there for goodluck or filling them up with rice and leaving them on the chairs at the ceremony so that our guests can throw rice at us. &amp;nbsp;Not sure which one. &amp;nbsp;I think rose petals might look nicer in pictures so i&#039;m not sure yet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My future mother in law also bought us these fans and they come with their own organza bag. &amp;nbsp;We will placing these on each chair so that our guests can keep cool.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And finally, I made myself a necklace to match my pretty passport holder! &amp;nbsp;yay! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;91 days til Mexico ...oh my god.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889348,"PostDate":1426452324,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> - totally talking Les Mills. \u00a0The FI and I a double class today, step class first and then pump! \u00a0Such a good morning. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We made some progress this weekend. \u00a0We bought the grooms gifts. \u00a0We found some great gifts at Fossil. \u00a0A travel bag perfect for the destination wedding with a luggage tag, passport holder. \u00a0I loved the passport holder because not only does carry the obvious, your passport but it has a special slot for the boarding pass and luggage receipt and a pen to fill out the travel cards in the plane. \u00a0Love it. \u00a0They also have a little card carrier for their hotel room key and some bills. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889348]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-30208900-1426469397.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0035.JPG -  113.34KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-30208900-1426469397.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0035.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I took pictures of my bridesmaid gifts earlier but my camera was dying and my pics turned out yellowish so I retook them because they didn't do Kate Spade any justice. \u00a0I am making them all jewellery for their dresses. \u00a0Haven't designed the jewellery yet but I am also giving them this necklace that will be perfect for dinners at night. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889348]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-78195200-1426469605.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0047.JPG -  67.27KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-78195200-1426469605.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0047.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance surprised me with a beachbag - so I'm totally getting so excited to start packing these things away. \u00a0Overwhelmed.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889348]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-12015800-1426469861.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0055.JPG -  97.19KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-12015800-1426469861.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0055.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think we found our cake topper. \u00a0Everyone I show it to doesn't get it though. \u00a0It's the \"&\" sign. \u00a0lol so we may use it as part of the decor at the reception and place it in front and centre of us. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889348]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-79641900-1426469986.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0046.JPG -  49.02KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-79641900-1426469986.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0046.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My future mother in law found these adorably cute shells with a little zipper. \u00a0 I was thinking of either including them as a souvenir in our OOTD bags and putting a peso in there for goodluck or filling them up with rice and leaving them on the chairs at the ceremony so that our guests can throw rice at us. \u00a0Not sure which one. \u00a0I think rose petals might look nicer in pictures so i'm not sure yet.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889348]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-45352200-1426470054.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0041.JPG -  57.54KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-45352200-1426470054.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0041.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My future mother in law also bought us these fans and they come with their own organza bag. \u00a0We will placing these on each chair so that our guests can keep cool.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889348]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-31244000-1426470224.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0043.JPG -  68.82KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-31244000-1426470224.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0043.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And finally, I made myself a necklace to match my pretty passport holder! \u00a0yay! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889348]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-21174400-1426470278.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0052.JPG -  63.16KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-21174400-1426470278.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0052.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>91 days til Mexico ...oh my god.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"014b607e0b76a69c799cc78712f26bfe","RawContent":"Everything is awesome!!! We got our groomsmen fossil shaving kits from an outlet. Was a stellar deal :)\n\n\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889349,"PostDate":1426452491,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Everything is awesome!!! We got our groomsmen fossil shaving kits from an outlet. Was a stellar deal <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.68.33.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a209cc7d6ca7b1d46a31907e7ccf16e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] &amp;nbsp; oh yes, the outlets and I are best friends for life! &amp;nbsp;hahaha&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Oh and while i was organizing my things today I found the groom&#039;s vow book! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889351,"PostDate":1426453032,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> \u00a0 oh yes, the outlets and I are best friends for life! \u00a0hahaha\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p>Oh and while i was organizing my things today I found the groom's vow book! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889351]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-12453600-1426471025.jpg\" title=\"DSC_0050.JPG -  46.17KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-277519-0-12453600-1426471025.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"DSC_0050.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.53.12.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80274269a292f742db50270458a9b398","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Omg I love it!! Love the groomsmen gifts too.. so thoughtful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where did you get those adorable little vow booklets?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889355,"PostDate":1426454157,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Omg I love it!! Love the groomsmen gifts too.. so thoughtful.<\/p>\n<p>Where did you get those adorable little vow booklets?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419419814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":289,"TotalPages":29,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
